  "description": "My first love murdered my family.\n\n*“...Why on earth did you do that?”\n\n“I did it for you.”*\n\nFacing Sung Ji-Seong, who was released early after receiving a special pardon without even serving his full sentence, Jo Ye-Seong resolves to kill him with his own hands. But stabbing Ji-Seong, his first love, with his own hands isn't easy... \n\n*“No one else would have done more for you than I did.”*\n\nEven knowing those words were nonsense, I kept wavering, unable to kill Ji-Seung.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
